Create a Permissions Problem

A deny rule was intentionally added for LabUser to simulate an access problem.

Command
icacls "%USERPROFILE%\Desktop\IT-LAB\Confidential" /deny LabUser:(OI)(CI)F
Result

The ACL now contains:

LabUser:(OI)(CI)(N)

N means No Access.

This intentionally creates an access-control problem for the test user.
